## Council Ecosystem

- This repository is one council inside a larger ecosystem of peer council repos that share the same generation, federation, rule, and skill model.
- Edit source-of-truth files: `.council/roster.yaml`, `.council/templates/**/*.j2`, package templates, rules, and skills.
- Do not hand-edit generated outputs under `.claude/`, `.codex/`, `CLAUDE.md`, or `AGENTS.md`; regenerate them with `council update`.
- Upstream-managed hook defaults live in `.council/templates/claude/hooks/defaults/`. Local council-specific customization belongs in `.council/templates/claude/hooks/_*.j2`.
